  "Scripture source: the Open Luganda Contemporary Bible (OLCB 2017, Biblica, CC BY-SA), parsed from the ebible mirror's USX (bibles/lug_bib), all 66 books. Translators looked up every quotation (cited or not) in that verse file and copied the bytes by script.",
